tax invoice because DoorDash will withhold the fees and tax from
your regular payout.

Learn more about tax invoices [here](https://help.doordash.com/merchants/s/article/Canada-Merchant-Tax-Invoice-FAQ).
[Download now](http://www.doordash.com/merchant/financials/tax-invoices?store_id=33598081)

*Please note, DoorDash cannot provide tax advice. If you have any
questions about your own taxes, please consult a tax
professional.

